Publish live preview, completion sidecar and WAV recording for file-output sessions.

Write PATH.live while a file-output streaming session runs, write
PATH.done on streamed completion, keep a 16-bit mono WAV at PATH.wav,
enlarge the streaming capture channel for slow CPUs, and apply
StreamingEvent::Whole for file-output sessions.

